e.json","size_bytes":180}},"finished_at":null,"global_name":"bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-6u.1","local_name":"bob-cli-6u.1","metadata":{"agent_clan":"bob-cli-6u","agent_clan_generation":"20261012102656","bead_id":"bob-cli-6u.1","changespec_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","cl_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","clan_summary":"[bold #D75FFF]◆ EPIC bob-cli-6u[/bold #D75FFF]\n[dim]  Title: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]Project blocking from the ^prj line,[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]A project's prerequisites live on its `^prj` task's ordinary [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]Depends-On line and its date as an inline `\\[scheduled::]` on [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]`^prj`; no project frontmatter `depends_on` or `scheduled` remains.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]While `^prj` has its own reason to be Blocked, every open task in [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]its note is Blocked `[?]` and tagged `#prj_is_blocked`, and no [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]Blocked task keeps a Task Link under today's open Pomodoros. Every [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]automatic Blocked → Ready recovery writes `\\[unblocked:: D]`, so the[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]task is a TICKLER in the next morning review. The YAML-storage [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]code, docs, and deployed bundle left behind by the canceled epic [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]bob-cli-6s are removed or salvaged.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]17[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]8[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202610/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]prj_line_project_blocking.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202610/prj_line_project_blocking.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-6u[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-6u/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Line-model project contract, PDT tag vectors, and UB unblock [/bold #D7AFFF] [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]vectors[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]contract[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]contract: rewrite docs/task-dependencies.md §13 for the ^prj line model [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF](drop the YAML storage, R0 hoist, property R-rules, PDP/PDW), repair the[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]other sections 75e323b made false, and add the #prj_is_blocked and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]\\[unblocked::] contracts with PDT and UB vectors.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Remove the YAML model and rebuild project reasons from the [/bold #D7AFFF]   [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]^prj line[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]cli-model[dim] · [dim][/dim]after contract[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]cli-model: delete 54a54bf's frontmatter reader, depends_on parse/splice,[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and target resolution; revert its incidental changes; rebuild [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]ProjectContext and project reasons from the ^prj line; add the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]#prj_is_blocked line helper.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Rust freshness reads and writes \\[unblocked::][/bold #D7AFFF]                 [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]cli-freshness[dim] · [dim][/dim]after contract[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]cli-freshness: placement (run-extending key, mark/clear/prune helpers, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]stamps clear it, lint), evaluator (RESURFACED from scheduled or [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]unblocked, TICKLER due_on, tie order, keeps), bob freshness output and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]schema bump, UB vectors.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Projects sync and capture + use the inline ^prj date[/bold #D7AFFF]          [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]cli-projects[dim] · [dim][/dim]after cli-model[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]cli-projects: sync hoists frontmatter scheduled onto ^prj, stops [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]deleting inline ^prj dates, reads propagation/#hide/marker from ^prj, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]places Sub-projects after Depends-On; capture + writes the date inline; [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]help, docs, and tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Reconcile derives project blocking, maintains the tag, and [/bold #D7AFFF]   [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]writes \\[unblocked::][/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]cli-reconcile-block[dim] · [dim][/dim]after cli-model, cli-freshness[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]cli-reconcile-block: project reasons in the transition loop, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]internal-target guard, implicit edges and ADJ-11, #prj_is_blocked [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]maintenance, \\[unblocked::] on Unblock plus prune, line-rewrite plans, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]outputs, help text, live dry run.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Reconcile consumes Task Links to Blocked tasks[/bold #D7AFFF]                [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]cli-reconcile-consume[dim] · [dim][/dim]after cli-reconcile-block[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]cli-reconcile-consume: remove live links to effectively Blocked tasks [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]under today's open Pomodoros after seeding promotion, then emptied [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Pomodoros; consumed_blocked_references output, docs, PDL tests, live dry[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]run.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  7 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Close and recovery paths respect project blocking and write [/bold #D7AFFF]  [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]\\[unblocked::][/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]cli-close[dim] · [dim][/dim]after cli-model, cli-freshness[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]cli-close: StillBlockedProject verdict, residents recover with their [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]^prj (tag stripped), Ready recoveries write \\[unblocked::], recovery [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]parity, PDC and UB close tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  8 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Capture & on ^prj blocks residents; project graph edges and [/bold #D7AFFF]  [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]promotion guards[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]cli-capture-deps[dim] · [dim][/dim]after cli-model[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]cli-capture-deps: & with a ^prj dependent refuses same-note targets and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]blocks, tags, and unlinks residents; implicit resident edges in cycle [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]checks; plan_promotions never raises ^prj.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  9 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Capture never links a Blocked task[/bold #D7AFFF]                            [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]cli-capture-links[dim] · [dim][/dim]after cli-capture-deps, cli-projects[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]cli-capture-links: link-toggle consumption at every plan_task_link [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]caller, the gesture rule (date-blocked ^prj refused), and unlinked [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]tagged [?] results for new tasks in blocked projects, @route:id s:N, and[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]blocked + projects.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  10 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]bob-ledger-tools evaluator and api.freshness learn [/bold #D7AFFF]          [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black o